.TH BOOTSTRAP.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-bigredbox 2.0.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
bootstrap.sh \- create or update the mu2edaq\-bigredbox virtual environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./bootstrap.sh
.RB [ \-\-dev ]
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates
.I venv/
next to the script (if absent) with
.BR "python3 \-m venv" ,
upgrades
.BR pip ,
and installs the package editable with
.BR "pip install \-e ." ,
which reads
.I pyproject.toml
(PyQt6 and PyYAML).
It does not read
.IR requirements.txt .
.PP
If
.B mu2edaq_discovery
is not importable in the venv, the script installs the sibling checkout
.I ../mu2edaq\-discovery
editable when it exists, otherwise tries
.B git+https://github.com/Mu2e/mu2edaq\-discovery
and continues without discovery if that fails.
.PP
Paths are resolved relative to the script, so it may be run from any
directory.
The script runs with
.BR "set \-euo pipefail" .
.PP
System libraries are not installed.
On EL9 the listener also needs the X11 client libraries
.RB ( libxkbcommon\-x11 ", " xcb\-util\-cursor ", " mesa\-libEGL )
and
.BR pulseaudio\-libs ;
without the latter the listener cannot start (see
.BR mu2edaq\-bigredbox (1)).
The closing message names
.BR start_daq_alert.sh ,
the legacy symlink to
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-bigredbox.sh (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-dev
Also install the
.B dev
extra: pytest, pytest\-qt and build.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the script's header comment and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I venv/
The virtual environment.
.TP
.I pyproject.toml
Package metadata and dependencies.
.TP
.I ../mu2edaq\-discovery
Optional sibling checkout.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PYTHON
Interpreter used to create the venv; default
.BR python3 .
Must be Python 3.9 or newer.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success, or
.BR \-\-help .
.TP
.B 1
No interpreter or Python older than 3.9.
A failure of the final
.B "pip install \-e"
of the package ends the script with pip's own status (normally 1).
A failure installing
.B mu2edaq\-discovery
does not stop the script.
.TP
.B 2
Unknown option.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS 4
.nf
cd ~/mu2edaq\-main/mu2edaq\-bigredbox
\&./bootstrap.sh
\&./bootstrap.sh \-\-dev && QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen venv/bin/pytest \-q
PYTHON=/usr/bin/python3.11 ./bootstrap.sh
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-bigredbox.sh (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-bigredbox (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ Group, Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory.
